    <div class="eyebrow">A LITTLE CONTEXT</div>
    <h1>Hi, I’m Gloria<span class="plum">.</span></h1>
    <div class="prose about-prose">
      <p class="lede">This is my little corner of the internet—a notebook for the things I’m learning and the ideas I want to spend more time with.</p>
      <p>I’m interested in mathematics, machine learning, and the connections between them. This space brings together schoolwork, explanations, questions, and the occasional thought that doesn’t fit neatly into a subject.</p>
      <h2>Why a notebook?</h2>
      <p>Writing is a way of paying attention. I want a place to work through an idea carefully, notice what I don’t understand, and leave a trail I can come back to.</p>
      <p>Some entries will be polished; others will stay in the margins. All of them are a work in progress.</p>
      <h2>Find me elsewhere</h2>
      <p>You can find my code on <a href="https://github.com/plumessence" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a>, or follow new notes through the <a href="/rss.xml">RSS feed</a>.</p>
      <div class="signature">Gloria</div>
    </div>
